    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9467" root="حور" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْوَرِىٌّ</span></b>  A man (TA) <i>white,</i> or <i>fair,</i> (S, K,)
<i>of the people of the towns or villages.</i> (TA.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوَارِىٌّ</span>; of which the fem. is applied
in like manner to a woman.]

